From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Use current Poetry build backend

Allow the Poetry Core version supplied by Wrynose. Setuptools is not
needed for this pure-Python package when using its declared Poetry
backend instead of the legacy setup.py build.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [distribution build-tool compatibility]
Signed-off-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 pyproject.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -87,3 +87,3 @@
 [build-system]
-requires = ["poetry_core>=1,<2", "setuptools>=59,<70"]
+requires = ["poetry-core>=1"]
 build-backend = "poetry.core.masonry.api"
